WEBVTT

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:19.910
Hayato-kun...

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:27.460
Have we pinpointed 
Kisaragi Hayato's current location?

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:28.890
We have.

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:32.460
We've requested assistance 
from any Slayers close by.

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:36.970
He'll just have to hold it off 
until reinforcements arrive.

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:42.380
<i>You should be able to get through this...</i>

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:45.480
<i>No, I know you can,</i>

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:47.970
<i>Kisaragi Hayato.</i>

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:27.910
<b>The Diva's  Love Song</b>

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:27.910
<i>I didn't realize I'd lose so much mobility
and power without my variable suit.</i>

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:34.650
Hayato-kun, you focus on attacking!

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:37.210
Hundred On!

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:50.990
Sakura!

00:02:50.990 --> 00:02:53.860
I might not be able to attack, 
but I can defend!

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:54.820
Hayato-kun!

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:58.320
Thank you. You're a big help.

00:02:59.310 --> 00:03:01.070
I'm going to end this.

00:03:13.030 --> 00:03:17.030
Shatter!

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:30.510
Yay! That's my hubby!
I've fallen in love with you all over again!

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:34.100
D-Dummy, get off of me.
People are going to get the wrong idea.

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:36.360
I wouldn't mind.

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:39.890
Are you serious?

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:41.650
That's Kirishima Sakura, right?

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:42.530
I-I can't believe it.

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:42.530
No way.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:49.720
A Savage.

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:56.740
Sakura!

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.040
Fritz!

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:11.620
I'm here, too!

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:30.200
Hayato, I'm here to help... you.

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:33.080
Thanks, Emile. You saved us.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:34.530
Emile?

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:37.920
This is what you get for just
leaving me there like that.

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:48.270
Reitia!

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:49.370
I know!

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:15.940
<i>I couldn't get all the way to the core!</i>

00:05:19.740 --> 00:05:21.750
I'll finish it off, then!

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:29.250
It's regenerating?

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:31.220
It's a regenerater!

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:32.720
Regenerater?

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:34.320
We learned about them in class, right?

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:36.830
It's a Savage with the ability 
to heal itself.

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:43.020
We just need to get its core...

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:46.370
I'm going to cut off its arms again...

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:49.040
Fritz and Reitia, can you cover me?

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:49.740
No problem.

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:51.700
Hayato, you finish it off.

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:53.870
Sure. But...

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:55.950
I'm fine.

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:59.550
You do what you need to do.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:01.730
Sakura...

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:04.550
Got it.

00:06:05.610 --> 00:06:08.550
Hayato, did something happen 
with Kirishima-san?

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:10.720
O-Of course not.

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:12.350
I don't believe you.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:15.350
Can you two save your
lovers' quarrel for later?

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:18.360
Let's go!

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:19.350
Yeah!

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:36.280
Hayato!

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:39.460
How can it regenerate its arms that fast?!

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:46.010
Stop it!

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.720
<i>It reacted to her voice?</i>

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:52.410
Here we go!

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:04.410
Hayato-kun!

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:09.830
<i>Who's this guy?</i>

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.510
Hayato-kun! Hayato-kun!

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:16.240
<i>That girl's voice</i>

00:07:16.820 --> 00:07:18.770
<i>was able to get through to the Savage?</i>

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:21.500
Interesting.

00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:25.190
Hayato-kun, are you okay?

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:38.930
Trace On.

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:01.150
Not happening.

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:14.460
Limit out.

00:08:25.340 --> 00:08:26.980
Who are these guys?

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:41.970
If he gets that much of its juices on himself...

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:43.210
Hey! Stop it!

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:46.640
You're going to get infected and go crazy!

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:51.710
I told you to stop!

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:53.300
Reitia!

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:55.510
Don't get in Nesat's way!

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:56.720
How dare you!

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:58.140
Too slow!

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:02.380
Fritz!

00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:03.980
You've done it now!

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:06.150
Emile!

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:08.110
Not on my watch!

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:12.990
Oh? You managed to stop my Orthrus Liberio?

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:15.860
<i>Are these guys...</i>

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:19.120
During the Savage attack last month,

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:24.750
a variable stone was stolen from
 the concert venue amid all that chaos.

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:27.620
Hayato-kun!

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:28.000
Stay away!

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:32.710
<i>Little Garden's</i> lapdog is
 trying to act like a prince, huh?

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:37.930
That puny sword isn't going to do 
anything against my Duo Valga!

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:44.090
You're doing pretty well 
without your variable suit.

00:09:44.610 --> 00:09:46.500
However, this is the end.

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:50.450
<i>He's a Variant?</i>

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:55.940
Get crushed!

00:09:58.500 --> 00:09:59.070
Hayato!

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:00.450
Keep your eyes on your opponent!

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:17.880
The form of his Hundred changed.

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:23.560
Looks like he has special abilities, 
in line with Nee-chan.

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:26.340
What are you after?!

00:10:27.240 --> 00:10:29.060
Looks like our work here is done.

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:30.520
Work?

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:37.050
Those are Savage cores...

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:41.200
Krovanh, they're getting closer.

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:44.350
How about we bounce, then, Nee-chan?

00:10:46.050 --> 00:10:50.520
I'm sure Vitaly will be happy 
if we bring this many cores back.

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:52.120
Vitaly...

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:56.380
Looks like you get to live another day.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:02.780
Want to chase after them?

00:11:04.590 --> 00:11:05.860
No...

00:11:06.450 --> 00:11:09.270
We can't do anything about them right now.

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:11.760
Not in this state, no.

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:16.030
There's the rescue squad.

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:29.640
You probably ran into poachers,

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:30.870
Hunters.

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:32.480
Hunters?

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:38.560
Slayers who are part of illegal organizations 
that don't necessarily follow the law.

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:44.580
The corpse of the remaining single unknown 
Savage was found in the wastelands.

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:47.120
The core was removed, as well.

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:48.660
They did that too, huh?

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:50.590
Most likely.

00:11:50.590 --> 00:11:52.760
But why the cores?

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:59.000
Because the molecular structure of Savage cores
 is almost the same as a variable stone.

00:11:57.750 --> 00:11:59.000
Wait!

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:01.340
You can't tell normal students that!

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:04.540
There's no point in hiding it from them.

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:07.710
Or are you trying to say that kids 
don't need to know about that,

00:12:07.710 --> 00:12:11.030
much like your brother and father do?

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:19.950
Does that mean a Savage core can be
reconfigured to function as a Hundred?

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:20.830
That's right.

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:24.680
In practice, it means that a core has 
the same worth as a variable stone.

00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:26.470
Monetarily, as well.

00:12:27.090 --> 00:12:31.350
It could also change 
the power balance of a country.

00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:34.470
Anyway, this conversation 
is to be considered top-secret.

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:39.360
I'm just glad you're all safe.

00:12:41.180 --> 00:12:44.220
Actually, why did you guys come to help?

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:46.700
After I got the emergency call,

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:48.760
I contacted those two.

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:51.500
I knew they were close by.

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:52.980
About that...

00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:56.130
Fritz Glanz, Reitia Saintemilion...

00:12:56.610 --> 00:13:01.560
I cannot permit anyone to go 
into battle without approval first.

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:03.690
Emile Crossfode.

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:08.940
It was possible that your actions could have 
led the two of them to their deaths.

00:13:08.940 --> 00:13:10.590
I want you to think about what you did.

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:11.890
Right...

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:17.590
However, I believe you demonstrated 
exemplary traits in an emergency situation.

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:22.220
I will consider your entry into Selections.

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:26.190
We did it.

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:30.520
Yeah.

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:37.060
I'm sorry about today.

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:40.390
I know we were on a date...

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:43.310
No, it's not like it was your fault.

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:46.040
The clothes I got are all ruined, too.

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:49.000
We can just get new ones.

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:52.590
Could you pick them out for me again?

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:53.720
Sure!

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:56.730
Hey, stop. This is bad.

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:57.740
I don't wanna.

00:13:57.740 --> 00:14:00.120
What are you going to do if someone sees us?

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:01.960
It's fine.

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:03.480
No, it isn't.

00:14:12.860 --> 00:14:14.380
Tomorrow's the big day.

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:15.190
Yeah.

00:14:16.010 --> 00:14:19.690
I finally get to sing in this special place
for my mother and me.

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:22.960
Yeah, that was always a dream of yours.

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:27.570
Sing for your mom.

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:33.350
No, Nii-san!

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:36.210
Watch closely. This is how you do it!

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:37.030
Right...

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:39.600
Do a good job.

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:42.750
You're Sakura's bodyguard, Nii-san.

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:45.160
Don't be an embarrassment
while cheering for her.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:47.490
Sorry.

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:50.060
Okay, one more time from the beginning.

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:57.540
Sakura?

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:17.200
Is your body okay?

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:20.800
I might be artificially created,
but I'm a Variant, too.

00:15:20.800 --> 00:15:22.780
I'm completely fine.

00:15:22.780 --> 00:15:23.700
That's good.

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:27.230
Karen's really looking 
forward to your concert.

00:15:29.270 --> 00:15:30.740
Looking forward to, huh...

00:15:32.480 --> 00:15:33.370
Sakura?

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:37.490
Everyone says they like my songs.

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:43.690
That Kirishima Sakura's songs 
reach deep into their hearts.

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:47.700
But that really isn't the case.

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:54.280
The reason why my songs affect everyone 
is because I'm not your normal singer.

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:58.020
It's because I'm a Variant.

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:00.240
What do you mean?

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:09.200
Currently, a large number of humans 
are infected with the Variant virus,

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:12.490
and that's what I tap into, 
since I'm a Variant.

00:16:13.650 --> 00:16:15.980
That's why I can touch their hearts.

00:16:16.820 --> 00:16:19.070
That's why they say they like my songs.

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:24.010
My singing is nothing but deception.

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:25.540
Sakura...

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:29.770
My songs aren't reaching anyone.

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:34.370
My actual singing isn't...

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:37.780
I don't think that's true.

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:41.540
Your songs have something about them.

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:43.940
So the virus has nothing to do with it.

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:45.900
You saw it too, didn't you, Hayato-kun?

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:48.410
That Savage reacted to my voice!

00:16:48.990 --> 00:16:50.900
That was because of the virus, too...

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:51.530
Back then...

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:56.860
Back then, I thought 
your song was really good.

00:16:58.480 --> 00:17:01.330
I don't know much about music,

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:04.180
but your singing makes me feel better.

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:08.040
Your song reached deep into the hearts 
of both Karen and me.

00:17:09.450 --> 00:17:12.270
That was before you became a Variant, right?

00:17:13.180 --> 00:17:13.730
Yeah...

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:15.410
It's okay.

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:17.850
Your voice is reaching everyone fine.

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:22.100
Hayato-kun, thank you.

00:17:23.110 --> 00:17:27.110
I think I'm going to fall 
even deeper in love with you.

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:30.860
I'm going to do my best 
during tomorrow's concert.

00:17:31.310 --> 00:17:33.610
Yeah. I'm looking forward to it.

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:56.340
Hundred On!

00:18:09.780 --> 00:18:12.630
Here I go, everyone!

00:18:12.930 --> 00:18:16.200
Have fun today!

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:55.770
This is great! Sakura-san's so cool!

00:18:55.770 --> 00:18:56.650
Yeah.

00:19:13.470 --> 00:19:18.290
I'm going to sing this song 
in front of all of you for the first time.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:22.680
It's a precious song to me.

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:32.560
This is...

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:33.900
Do you remember?

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:45.330
Could that girl from back then be....

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:51.500
...Sakura-san?

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:07.210
<i>Her song is reaching...</i>

00:21:08.890 --> 00:21:10.340
<i>...everyone's hearts.</i>

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:11.700
<i>It really is.</i>

00:21:26.580 --> 00:21:28.420
I still can't believe it.

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:32.250
I didn't know that Sakura-san 
was the girl we met.

00:21:32.550 --> 00:21:34.140
I feel the same way.

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:40.150
That night I met the two of you, 
I realized just how fun singing could be.

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:43.580
Thanks to that, I became a singer.

00:21:45.180 --> 00:21:48.930
It's been a while. Thank you, Karen-chan.

00:21:50.010 --> 00:21:52.580
S-Same here!

00:21:53.890 --> 00:21:56.620
Let's sing together next time we meet.

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:58.080
Like we did before.

00:21:59.110 --> 00:22:00.170
S-Sure!

00:22:04.530 --> 00:22:07.760
Charlotte, about Sakura's voice...

00:22:08.060 --> 00:22:09.390
Leave it to me.

00:22:09.390 --> 00:22:12.030
I'll look into it, I promise.

00:22:12.510 --> 00:22:15.180
I owe you that much.

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:19.240
Hayato-kun, we were only together 
for a short time, but thank you.

00:22:19.240 --> 00:22:19.860
Yeah.

00:22:29.850 --> 00:22:31.840
S-S-Sakura-san is

00:22:31.840 --> 00:22:34.120
k-kissing Nii-san?!

00:22:35.390 --> 00:22:37.790
I'll definitely come and 
see you again, Hayato-kun!

00:22:38.430 --> 00:22:40.790
Really soon!

00:22:49.210 --> 00:22:51.510
Hayato-kun... Hayato-kun.

00:22:53.200 --> 00:22:54.250
Heavy...

00:22:55.000 --> 00:22:55.560
Huh?

00:22:59.590 --> 00:23:00.400
S-Sorry!

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:03.690
Sakura? Why...?

00:23:03.980 --> 00:23:07.980
I told you I'd come to see you really soon.

00:23:13.240 --> 00:23:14.600
Kirishima Sakura!

00:23:14.600 --> 00:23:17.410
I'm going to detain you 
on the charge of illegal trespassing.

00:23:17.410 --> 00:23:19.160
Hayato-kun, I'm scared!

00:23:22.670 --> 00:23:23.960
Good morning!

00:23:24.420 --> 00:23:27.050
Why are the president and Kirishima-san here?!

00:23:27.050 --> 00:23:29.810
You two are in the way, so leave.

00:23:29.810 --> 00:23:30.930
Right, Hayato-kun?

00:23:31.420 --> 00:23:33.430
"Hayato-kun," my foot!

00:23:33.430 --> 00:23:35.710
Get away from Kisaragi Hayato!

00:23:35.710 --> 00:23:37.570
Hey, this is the men's dorm.

00:23:37.570 --> 00:23:39.470
Girls can't come in here!

00:23:39.470 --> 00:23:43.150
That's why the president and this girl 
need to leave right now!

00:23:43.430 --> 00:23:45.770
I'm amazed you have the gall to say that!

00:23:46.090 --> 00:23:48.530
You need to remember your position here!

00:23:48.010 --> 00:23:49.580
W-Wait!

00:23:49.580 --> 00:23:50.530
I do!

00:23:50.530 --> 00:23:52.530
Get out, all of you!

00:23:52.530 --> 00:23:54.320
No!

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:05.740
<b>The Captured Wild Rose Princess</b>
